    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "PPC:AM",
    "definition_raw": "You know how to adjust the amount of time required for a poison to take effect.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Craft (alchemy) 11 ranks, Toxicological Timing.\n\nBenefit(s): Whenever you craft a poison with the Craft (alchemy) skill, you can add or subtract up to 1 day from its onset time (to a minimum onset period of 1 round).",
